  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだね……俺が『みんな』を大切に思うのは……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……それって、相手のことをちゃんと\n理解していないってことになるのかもしれないね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "悪いことだとは思いませんよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "相手を理解する、理解しようとすることで、\n問題が生じる場合もありますからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "通じ合えたと思えば勘違いだったり、\n寄り添おうとして拒絶されたり……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……長い間そばにいたのに、\n何も知らないまま別れがくることもある）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それでも、渡辺さんの場合は……\n他人のことを本当に理解したいと思いますか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それは……。\n君が俺に、理解してほしいと思うのなら。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それなら、俺は挑戦したいかな。\nだから、北斗さんがどう思うかが聞きたいよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……。\nふふ、渡辺さんには敵わないな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "意地悪な質問だった？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ、少し。ですが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自分がどうしたいのか……。そういう熱さを、\nここでたくさん見つけていきたいと思いました。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "何度だって、いくつだって見つかるよ。\n315プロって、そういう場所だから！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_f:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 18,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうですね。\nあなたのように素敵な大人が、大勢いますから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
